@HealthY.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5252
# TIP: Kør "login" først, og kopiér token herind.
@token = INDSÆT_TOKEN_HER

### Opret bruger
POST {{HealthY.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "birgit@example.com", "password": "hemmelig123", "birthYear": 1947 }

### Log ind
POST {{HealthY.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "birgit@example.com", "password": "hemmelig123" }

### Mine gåture
GET {{HealthY.Api_HostAddress}}/api/walks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ny gåtur
POST {{HealthY.Api_HostAddress}}/api/walks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-10-09", "minutes": 20, "steps": null, "note": "Gik ved stranden" }

### Ugens tal
GET {{HealthY.Api_HostAddress}}/api/summary/week
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dagens ret
GET {{HealthY.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipes/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
